1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,451
On the way to Mars, help from Earth is twenty minutes away.

2
00:00:03,751 --> 00:00:06,763
Meet AURA. It learns every astronaut's own baseline,

3
00:00:06,763 --> 00:00:10,876
and gives a clear Normal, Warning, or Critical status, with the reason.

4
00:00:11,176 --> 00:00:14,589
It spots trouble days early, and turns it into a plan for today.

5
00:00:14,889 --> 00:00:17,711
Messages to ground carry the real signal delay,

6
00:00:17,711 --> 00:00:20,052
and a live flight surgeon answers back.

7
00:00:20,352 --> 00:00:22,581
Ask AURA by voice, even offline.

8
00:00:22,581 --> 00:00:25,856
It's built on real NASA Inspiration4 crew data.

9
00:00:26,156 --> 00:00:29,420
AURA. Your crew's health, even when Earth is twenty minutes away.

